</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’ve tried my best, but still have failed,</l><l>E’en as before I’ve failed and erred;</l><l>Thy patience is my only trust</l><l>To hold and keep me to Thy word.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Whene’er my heart is lifted up,</l><l>How very near I am to fall;</l><l>I dare not do, I dare not think,</l><l>I need Thyself in great or small.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou art my Savior, strength and stay,</l><l>O Lord, I come to seek Thy face;</l><l>Though I’m the weakest of the weak,</l><l>My strength is nothing but Thy grace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
